# Waterlogged Hulk // Watertight Gondola. The Hulk's "{T}: Mill a card" (twice), Emry, Lurker of the Loch's "mill four
# cards" and Overlord of the Balemurk's (cast for its impending cost) put ten Islands into Bot1's graveyard; on turn five
# "Craft with Island {3}{U}" (CR 702.167a-b) exiles one of those Island cards and the Hulk returns as Watertight Gondola, a
# 4/4 Vehicle with vigilance. On turn seven Emry crews it (Crew 1) and it attacks beside an Ornithopter: with nine
# permanent cards in Bot1's graveyard, "Descend 8 - This Vehicle can't be blocked" holds, so Bot2's Ornithopter may not
# block it (refused) and blocks the other attacker instead. Vigilance leaves it untapped.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Waterlogged Hulk
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Emry, Lurker of the Loch
Overlord of the Balemurk
Ornithopter
Island x9
Island
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x20

